@1000 = ~Javelin~
@1001 = ~Javelins are light, flexible spears designed primarily as a throwing weapon. They are usually constructed of wood and tipped with a small metal spearhead. The shaft is much thinner than a two-handed spear. The javelin is a ranged weapon, intended to be thrown. While javelins can be used for melee combat, they are not sturdy enough and perform poorly.

STATISTICS:

Damage: 1d%ranged_die% (thrown, missile)
Damage: 1d%melee_die% (melee, piercing)
Speed Factor: 4
Proficiency Type: Spear
Type: One-handed
Requires:
 5 Strength

Weight: 3~
@1002 = ~Javelin +1~
@1003 = ~Javelins are light, flexible spears designed primarily as a throwing weapon. They are usually constructed of wood and tipped with a small metal spearhead. The shaft is much thinner than a two-handed spear. The javelin is a ranged weapon, intended to be thrown. While javelins can be used for melee combat, they are not sturdy enough and perform poorly.

This javelin has been enhanced magically. Runes can be seen glowing on every surface.

