@1004 = ~Poisoned Javelin~
@1005 = ~Javelins are light, flexible spears designed primarily as a throwing weapon. They are usually constructed of wood and tipped with a small metal spearhead. The shaft is much thinner than a two-handed spear. The javelin is a ranged weapon, intended to be thrown. While javelins can be used for melee combat, they are not sturdy enough and perform poorly.

A thin coating of poison has been applied to each spearhead.

STATISTICS:

Combat abilities:
– Hit target must save vs. Death or suffer 2 points of poison damage per second for 10 seconds

